ghostcite — third-party data attribution
=========================================

Retraction data (optional feature: `ghostcite fetch-retractions` and
`--retraction-db`):

  Retraction Watch database, compiled by The Center for Scientific Integrity,
  acquired and made publicly available by Crossref, and distributed via
  Crossref Labs (https://www.crossref.org/labs/retraction-watch/).

  ghostcite downloads this dataset on demand directly from Crossref's endpoint;
  it is NOT bundled with or redistributed as part of this package. When you use
  the offline retraction feature, please credit Crossref and Retraction Watch
  (The Center for Scientific Integrity) as the data source.

